---

<PageLayout
  title="ホーム"
  description="MINT-COINは、アンティークコイン・モダンコインの基礎知識、シリーズ解説、グレーディング、海外市場情報を整理して発信する情報サイトです。"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <!-- The opening video covers the whole hero, so the hero height is also the video height -->
  <section id="hero" class="relative bg-ivory pt-12 pb-16 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-24 overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Opening video (muted). Plays once, then fades out to reveal the normal hero. -->
    <div id="hero-video-wrap" class="absolute inset-0 z-20 bg-black hidden" aria-hidden="true">
      <video
        id="hero-video"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        muted
        playsinline
        preload="auto"
        poster="/videos/otakara_20_poster.jpg"
      ></video>
      <button
        id="hero-video-skip"
        type="button"
        class="absolute right-4 bottom-4 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs tracking-wide text-white/80 border border-white/40 rounded bg-black/30 hover:bg-black/50 hover:text-white transition-colors"
      >
        スキップ
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Decorative coin photos — place transparent PNG files in /public/coins/ -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none select-none" aria-hidden="true">
      <!-- Una and the Lion — top-left, large -->
      <div style="position:absolute;left:-30px;top:-25px;width:220px;height:220px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.18">
        <img src="/coins/una_lion.png" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(0.1) brightness(0.88)" />
      </div>
      <!-- Queen's Beasts — top-right -->
      <div style="position:absolute;right:-18px;top:8px;width:188px;height:188px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.17">
        <img src="/coins/queens-beasts.png" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(0.1) brightness(0.88)" />
      </div>
      <!-- Gothic Crown — bottom-left -->
      <div style="position:absolute;left:2%;bottom:-22px;width:172px;height:172px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.17">
        <img src="/coins/gothic-crown.png" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(0.1) brightness(0.88)" />
      </div>
      <!-- Tudor Beasts — bottom-right, large -->
      <div style="position:absolute;right:-18px;bottom:-18px;width:208px;height:208px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.18">
        <img src="/coins/tudor-beasts.png" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(0.1) brightness(0.88)" />
      </div>
      <!-- Three Graces — top-center -->
      <div style="position:absolute;left:42%;top:-18px;width:108px;height:108px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.14">
        <img src="/coins/three-graces.png" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(0.1) brightness(0.88)" />
      </div>
      <!-- Royal Mint — bottom center-right -->
      <div style="position:absolute;right:22%;bottom:12px;width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.13">
        <img src="/coins/royal-mint.png" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(0.1) brightness(0.88)" />
      </div>
      <!-- Queen's Beasts — center-left -->
      <div style="position:absolute;left:17%;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:82px;height:82px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.12">
        <img src="/coins/queens-beasts.png" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(0.1) brightness(0.88)" />
      </div>
      <!-- Una and the Lion — center-right -->
      <div style="position:absolute;right:17%;top:45%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;opacity:0.12">
        <img src="/coins/una_lion.png" alt="" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(0.1) brightness(0.88)" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <div class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-500 mx-auto mb-10"></div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-navy-900 leading-snug mb-6">
        アンティークコインを、<br />もっと身近に。
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 leading-loose">
        MINT-COINは、アンティークコイン・モダンコインの基礎知識、シリーズ解説、グレーディング、海外市場情報を整理して発信する情報サイトです。
      </p>
      <!-- Guide characters: Elsa and her parrot Mint (sits under the opening video while it plays) -->
      <div class="mt-10 sm:mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-6 sm:gap-8">
        <img
          src="/images/characters/elsa-mint.jpg"
          alt="冒険者のエルザと相棒のオウム、ミント"
          width="640"
          height="640"
          class="w-48 h-48 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 shrink-0 rounded-lg object-cover shadow-sm"
        />
        <div class="relative bg-navy-50 border border-navy-100 rounded-2xl px-6 py-5 text-left text-navy-900 leading-loose text-sm sm:text-base">
          <!-- Tail: points up on phones, left toward the image on larger screens -->
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute w-4 h-4 bg-navy-50 border-navy-100 rotate-45 left-1/2 -top-2 -translate-x-1/2 border-l border-t sm:left-0 sm:top-1/2 sm:-translate-y-1/2 sm:border-t-0 sm:border-b"></span>
          <p class="relative">
            私は冒険者のエルザ、こっちの相棒はミント。<br />
            世界中から色んなコインを集めてるんだ。<br />
            コインのことを調べてると、歴史も知れて<br />とっても楽しいんだ♪
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script is:inline>
    // Runs synchronously right after the hero markup so the overlay is in place before first paint.
    // If autoplay is blocked or the video fails, the overlay is dismissed and the normal hero is shown.
    // Phones get a lighter 480p file (~1.7MB); larger screens get 720p (~3.6MB).
    (function () {
      var wrap = document.getElementById('hero-video-wrap');
      var video = document.getElementById('hero-video');
      var skip = document.getElementById('hero-video-skip');
      if (!wrap || !video) return;
      var isSmall = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 767px)').matches;
      video.src = isSmall ? '/videos/otakara_20_sp.mp4' : '/videos/otakara_20_pc.mp4';
      wrap.classList.remove('hidden');
      var done = false;
      function finish() {
        if (done) return;
        done = true;
        video.pause();
        wrap.style.transition = 'opacity 1.2s ease';
        wrap.style.opacity = '0';
        setTimeout(function () { wrap.remove(); }, 1300);
      }
      video.addEventListener('ended', finish);
      video.addEventListener('error', finish);
      if (skip) skip.addEventListener('click', finish);
      var timer;
      video.addEventListener('playing', function () {
        clearTimeout(timer);
        timer = setTimeout(finish, 30000);
      }, { once: true });
      function start() {
        var p = video.play();
        if (p && p.catch) p.catch(finish);
        // Safety nets: give up if playback hasn't started within 8s, or runs well past the 20s length
        timer = setTimeout(finish, 8000);
      }
      // Chrome refuses to play muted video in a background tab, so wait until the tab is shown
      if (document.hidden) {
        document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', function onVisible() {
          if (document.hidden) return;
          document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange', onVisible);
          start();
        });
      } else {
        start();
      }
    })();
  </script>

  <!-- Hero actions — kept outside the hero so they stay clickable while the opening video plays -->
  <section class="bg-white pt-12 sm:pt-14">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="/coin-info/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap px-6 py-3 bg-navy-800 text-white text-sm font-medium tracking-wide rounded hover:bg-navy-900 transition-colors"
        >
          コインを学ぶ
        </a>
        <a
          href="/series/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap px-6 py-3 border border-navy-700 text-navy-800 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide rounded hover:bg-navy-50 transition-colors"
        >
          シリーズ解説を見る
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://auctions.yahoo.co.jp/seller/5mCsZ4pG5ofqP1fg7RqhV9nptw61m?user_type=c"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap px-6 py-3 bg-gold-600 text-white text-sm font-medium tracking-wide rounded hover:bg-gold-700 transition-colors"
        >
          Yahoo!オークション出品一覧
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M5 11l6-6M5.5 5H11v5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="sr-only">（新しいタブで開きます）</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured Series -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-4">人気シリーズ</h2>
        <div class="w-10 h-px bg-gold-500 mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {featuredSeries.map(({ name, nameJa, period, href, description }) => (
          <a
            href={href}
            class="group block p-8 border border-parchment rounded hover:border-navy-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all"
          >
            <p class="text-xs text-gold-600 tracking-wide mb-2">{period}</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-1">{name}</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-4">{nameJa}</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">{description}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gold-600 mt-5 group-hover:text-gold-500 transition-colors">
              詳しく見る →
            </p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Latest Columns -->
  <section class="bg-ivory py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-4">最新コラム</h2>
        <div class="w-10 h-px bg-gold-500 mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        {latestColumns.map(({ category, title, summary, href }) => (
          <a
            href={href}
            class="group block bg-white p-8 border border-parchment rounded hover:border-navy-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all"
          >
            <p class="text-xs font-medium text-gold-600 tracking-wide mb-3">{category}</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-base font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3 leading-snug group-hover:text-navy-700 transition-colors">
              {title}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">{summary}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gold-600 mt-5 group-hover:text-gold-500 transition-colors">
              続きを読む →
            </p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mt-10">
        <a
          href="/columns/"
          class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-navy-700 hover:text-navy-900 transition-colors"
        >
          コラム一覧を見る →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Categories -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-4">コインの基礎知識</h2>
        <div class="w-10 h-px bg-gold-500 mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        {categories.map(({ title, href, description, icon }) => (
          <a
            href={href}
            class="group block p-8 border border-parchment rounded hover:border-navy-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all"
          >
            <div class="text-navy-600 mb-5" set:html={icon} />
            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-2">{title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">{description}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gold-600 mt-5 group-hover:text-gold-500 transition-colors">
              詳しく見る →
            </p>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Grading Guide -->
  <section class="bg-ivory py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-gold-600 uppercase mb-4">Grading</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-4">グレーディングとは</h2>
          <div class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-500 mb-6"></div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-loose mb-4">
            コインの価値は「状態（グレード）」によって大きく変わります。世界標準の鑑定機関 PCGS・NGC が採用するシェルドンスケール（1〜70点）で状態を数値化し、透明性の高い売買を可能にします。
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-loose mb-8">
            最高グレードの MS70・PR70 から流通品まで、グレードの読み方とその意味を解説します。
          </p>
          <a
            href="/grading/"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3 border border-navy-700 text-navy-800 text-sm font-medium tracking-wide rounded hover:bg-navy-50 transition-colors"
          >
            グレーディングを学ぶ
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          {[
            { grade: 'MS 70', label: 'パーフェクト', desc: '肉眼で傷が確認できないほぼ完全な状態。' },
            { grade: 'MS 65–69', label: 'ジェム', desc: '光沢がありわずかな接触跡が認められる。コレクターに人気の高いグレード帯。' },
            { grade: 'PR / PF', label: 'プルーフ', desc: '鏡面仕上げのプルーフコイン専用グレード。背景の鏡面と図柄のフロストが特徴。' },
            { grade: 'AU 50–58', label: 'アバウト UNC', desc: '軽微な流通跡があるが、高い水準の保存状態。' },
          ].map(({ grade, label, desc }) => (
            <div class="bg-white p-5 border border-parchment rounded">
              <p class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-navy-800 mb-1">{grade}</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gold-600 mb-2">{label}</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">{desc}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
